{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"scorpionic-heavensent-zander","creation_channel":"cli","description":"## Context\n`infra/nginx/rebar.conf.template:1-37,44-53,89-201,249-300` contains historical narrative, repeated explanation, or implementation narration. Preserve TLS/HSTS, switchable MCP upstream, literal forwarded scheme, prefix/redirect rewriting, op-cert guard, SSE buffering/timeouts, RFC 9728 metadata, Gerrit proxy behavior. Content consumer: nginx/operators/security review.\n\n## Plan\nState the current contract once; remove obvious narration and relocate still-useful history or alternatives to its ticket, ADR, runbook, or maintained documentation.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] The cited prose is concise and current.\n- [ ] The preserve list remains explicit and accurate.\n- [ ] Behavior-bearing text remains complete for its recorded consumer.\n\n## Verification\nReview the diff against the preserve list and validate the affected workflow, script, or configuration.","id":"dd8b-d69a-57af-4f12","parent_id":"d8a3-ff71-8112-4e55","priority":3,"repos":["rebar"],"tags":["comments","documentation","maintainability"],"ticket_type":"task","title":"Condense comments in infra/nginx/rebar.conf.template"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1788559829240061001,"uuid":"5b6db15c-b6ec-49b6-82ae-f7d0a9bdbc97"}